            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{# Display only: inputs are watts reported within the last 180 seconds.\nNegative power is clamped to zero. Missing or stale readings remain unavailable.\nNo services are called and the source measurements and history are unchanged. #}\n{% set a='@@POWER_HP@@' %}{% set b='@@POWER_BACKUP@@' %}\n{% set av=states(a) %}{% set bv=states(b) %}\n{% set af=is_number(av) and (as_timestamp(now())-as_timestamp(states[a].last_reported,0))<=180 %}\n{% set bf=is_number(bv) and (as_timestamp(now())-as_timestamp(states[b].last_reported,0))<=180 %}\n{% set ap=([av|float,0]|max) if af else none %}\n{% set bp=([bv|float,0]|max) if bf else none %}\n## {{ ((ap+bp)|round(0)|int) ~ ' W' if ap is not none and bp is not none else 'Unavailable' }}\n**Current power · heat pump + electric backup**\n\nHeat pump: **{{ (ap|round(0)|int ~ ' W') if ap is not none else 'Unavailable' }}** · Backup: **{{ (bp|round(0)|int ~ ' W') if bp is not none else 'Unavailable' }}**\n\n_Negative power is displayed as 0 W. Energy below covers the current calendar week, month and year using import counters in kWh._",
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full"
              }
            },
